            <ArticleTitle>Rehabilitation in rheumatic diseases. What's new.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>545-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In the past decade, considerable change has occurred in concepts of rehabilitation in patients with rheumatic diseases. This includes approaches to functional assessment and outcome, new concepts in exercise, and new orthotics.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
